        "sid": "2CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bawlo ea giijasoodiga ng'uyyeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideabali ghwanyawa ghoamilikghti leendeedeanyu gilimwanang'. Amilikghta sea aniini! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini geashiseegwa ghaang' aba shidoodeaba ghaang' bea ASEETA, aba gideaba neanyeariiseegwa Gristo ak ghaadaydaneegwa awuurjeewana sibeeda miy weesa ng'eedeanagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghaabeali, gawuurji gidaghayi reenganiida ichibooda Hawa aba milmilandaanyi, gajeehuteawi fughareengeagwa ak ghoanung'waadi doobiiwnata ea alooheeda Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba iihidu siinuut ak gwarukuneegwa Yesu nuut nyooh ea mii dea ghayi sirukuneegwa, ghana oang'waanya guroorooda nuut mawoosa dea oang'waanyi, ghana iyoamwaschi giijasta miy nuut mawoosa dea ghayi oamwaschiiin, abeeda goosisi mureeda gidida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghaaghanyi manda gidashoadeawanaan aba gidamideawa giijasoodiga hees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi aniini eawooschi siida moamu gabalooliin, nih mii gideawuurjeewi aba fughareeda gil; naweadinga sean sinung'unyi ghwadaajiit ng'asheesu aba heedeang'wa aba haleanjeeda sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi aniini neasinyi riing'eeda iyaayaachi geaw ng'eanyi ak abeeda geakghaambiideegwa, aba gideaba ghayi gearukuneegwa giijasta miy bea ASEETA nea moataydani gili? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naareachi ganiisajeega suuk haleanjeeda nyaawa goonan saawa ak abeeda ghaaweacheegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aniini damanda sindeayeewi nea geegasayi weetean, ghanyea mii dasawan siida wassean, aba gideaba haleanjeeda eagasayi gagoonan fuga eaduupcheewi leabu Makedoniya. Ak geaheeleewi geaw haleanjeeda sean ak ea measawaneegwa aba gida wassean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawuurji gidabiideata huumeanda Gristo jeedeanyu, ghanyea manda siida jea gwadukuta ghuuteanyu aba ghwaroani bea geawiin aba darooraka ng'eanyiida Akaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba naaha? Gweagu gideaba mabwariinyeagwa agooga? Ghwanal ASEETA gideaba ghaabwariinyeegwa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gideagasayi dasin gaydasin, ak abeeda ghabwaanyi ng'asheegeaba fugiga gasa aba jeeda gadiyoojiga nyaawa bea ghwarjeedean gwasinda gadiyeeda gidasisindi aseasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga uurji suh giijasoodiga ng'uyyeenya, nea iissa gwasin gadiyeeda aba reengaweega, fuga iissa ghwayam geat ak gwasin geat giijasoodiga Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mayghaham fih ng'eanyi, aba gideaba eara Shataani iissa ghwayamyam geaw gawuurji malaykajeanda weeshinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ada abeeda ea mii ng'asheanda haw gil gideaba eara soomjoagaaschi earaga iissa ghwayam geat ak gawuurji soomjooga doobiiwnata. Huuydeanda nyaawa gaygawuurji sea gadiyoojiga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawanadeeda Bawloheeda was giijasoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gearugu gicha gideaba, adaghwanung' siida doaw gili eawooschi dasha; earapeadi oanung' dasinuun, amwastanaan siitasha, ak abeeda eara aniini ghaaghwarji geaw gilimwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ng'asheega eargu mearukuni aba gheambalmeeda Ng'utamiida geawuurjeewi siida dasha, aba jeedeaba ghwaroani bea geaw aararji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea fuga saang'a iissa ghaghwara geat haleanjeeda ng'eanyiida, ak eara aniini gaydaghwar geaw.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba hooseaneegeagwa ghamilikghta fuga dasheahi, nea agooga goowooschi weaghoodi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba iissa ghoamilikghti eara siida nung' ahuwa giing'oonyanga ghana ghwanukghutaneegwa, ghana ghwanyagaadawaneegwa, ghana ghwayiineegwa heetiyeada, ghana ghwalas gheamamuunatkeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba baspaseegeasu, gaydayi, aseasa geewooschi ng'arng'ari aba ng'asheanji!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gida wassean ghwara geaw siida gaydaamu eara aniini gaydaghwara geaw, geabalooldi siitasha, eara aniini gaydaamu daghwara geaw gidida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa ea fuga Ebraniyahi? Eara aniini geawooschi. Saawa fuga Israeli? Eara aniini geawooschi. Saawa jeata Abrahamu? Eara aniini geawooschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa soomjooga Gristohi? Ghaaraanyi aniini, geabalooldi siida geeska, biissa gaba gadiyeeda haw, ghaaraanyi muuchi aba ghealooniga, bea bayiiga mwoamu eeyiida, nea ghaariikghti aba miyeeda galeagasean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba heeda fuga Yahudi naanyaschi bayiiga niba muut naanyaschi bayi haradam shoada akaleala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibwaranaan fuga Rumi ng'aritka niba samwagu; ak ea sifuteewean lagheanga nibwagi. Ak ea ninyar maleambooda niba samwagu; ak geabiidi jeeda basooda eawa ea askweari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba bareanyeekeasu bea galeagasean, iissa gwaramaknean guldeayda ghealooniga iissa geashageadi aba fuga areedi buuneeda haleanjeeda, ak geashageadi aba eemeedeanya, ak geashageadi aba Eemoojiga, ak geashageadi aba mujiini, ak geashageadi aba dareapcheeda, ak geashageadi aba jeeda basooda, ak geashageadi aba fuga eaduupcheewi bea ng'uyyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba sawanadeeda ea deawiitmeeda, ea giing'weernooda galeagasean bea eawa, aba jalooda ea muwooshta, iissa ea hoaghuut ea meandeawani hamita, aba jeameeda ea ng'ayinda hang'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea mabeachi ng'asheesu, gwanda eara ng'asha suuk aba badaydeanyu bea galeagasean, nea machmajooda ng'ulooda ganiisajeega seani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea ng'eaha gil siida ng'arng'ar, ak ea mwaang'arng'ariidi aniini? Ak ea ng'eaha siida sinung' ghoabeada, ak ea mwaanyareasi aniini?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
